    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the forward lower shell skin panels and the longitudinal lap joint between stations 1080 and 1360, drawn as one joint configuration on a single sheet with no alternate items.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the skin panel details, the lap joint splice parts and the attaching hardware of the forward lower shell between stations 1080 and 1360, on the left and the right side of the aircraft.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn for the left side; the right side is a mirror image with the same part numbers except for the handed clip at item 50. Fastener quantities are given for one side only. One joint configuration is shown, with the aft splice plate at item 30 and the interfay sealant applied to the pattern of the referenced drawing. There is no alternate item on this sheet and no item carries a modification effectivity, so a station orders the same parts for every aircraft in the range."
    },
